  "description": "Extra field components and client-side services for Codeer.LowCode.Blazor. Includes Calendar, Gantt Chart, Task Board (Kanban), Rich Text Editor, Color Picker, Marker List, QR Code, Progress Bar, Password Hash, and AI Text Analyzer fields, plus built-in script objects (Excel, WebApi, Toaster, Mail) and client infrastructure services (HTTP, UI, logging, localization).",
